---
import Layout from '../components/layout/Layout.astro';
import Section from '../components/ui/Section.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms and Conditions" description="Terms and Conditions for Project Kabir - Your AI-powered travel companion">
  <Section background="white" padding="large">
    <div class="terms-container">
      <h1 class="page-title">Terms and Conditions</h1>
      <div class="terms-meta">
        <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> March 20, 2025</p>
        <p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> March 20, 2025</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="terms-intro">
        <p>Welcome to Kabir, your AI-powered travel companion. By accessing or using the Kabir mobile application (the "App"), you agree to comply with and be bound by these Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you must not use the App.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>By downloading, installing, or using the Kabir App, you agree to these Terms and Conditions, as well as any updates or modifications made to them.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>2. Description of Service</h2>
        <p>Kabir is an AI-powered virtual travel assistant that provides:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Location-based travel insights.</li>
          <li>AI-generated conversations for travel guidance.</li>
          <li>Navigation and historical information.</li>
          <li>User-generated content interactions.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>3. User Eligibility</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>You must be at least 18 years old or have parental/guardian consent to use the app.</li>
          <li>By using Kabir, you confirm that you have the legal capacity to enter into a binding agreement.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>4. User Accounts & Login</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Users may sign in via Google, Facebook, Apple ID, Email, or Phone Number.</li>
          <li>You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials.</li>
          <li>Unauthorized account use should be reported immediately to <a href="mailto:sagar@kabir-ai.com">sagar@kabir-ai.com</a>.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>5. Permitted Uses</h2>
        <p>You agree to use Kabir only for lawful purposes. You may not:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Use the app for fraudulent or misleading activities.</li>
          <li>Exploit, modify, or copy app content without permission.</li>
          <li>Engage in hacking, reverse engineering, or unauthorized access to our servers.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>6. Privacy & Data Collection</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Our collection and use of personal data are governed by our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
          <li>By using the app, you agree to the collection, processing, and storage of your data as per our Privacy Policy.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>7. AI Conversations & Accuracy</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Kabir provides AI-generated information and responses based on historical, cultural, and location-based data.</li>
          <li>While we strive for accuracy, Kabir should not be relied upon for legal, medical, or emergency advice.</li>
          <li>Users should verify critical travel information from official sources.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>8. Location Services</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Kabir uses real-time location data to provide personalized experiences.</li>
          <li>You may enable/disable location tracking in your device settings.</li>
          <li>Some features may not work correctly if location access is restricted.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>9. Intellectual Property Rights</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>All content in the app, including text, images, AI-generated responses, and design elements, are owned or licensed by Kabir.</li>
          <li>Users may not reproduce, distribute, or exploit app content for commercial purposes without permission.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>10. User Conduct & Restrictions</h2>
        <p>Users must not:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Use offensive, hateful, or illegal language in interactions.</li>
          <li>Attempt to manipulate or misuse the AI system.</li>
          <li>Violate any local, national, or international laws while using Kabir.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>11. Third-Party Services & Integrations</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Kabir may integrate with third-party services such as Google Maps, ChatGPT, and Firebase Authentication.</li>
          <li>Users are subject to the terms of these third-party services when using them through our app.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>12. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Kabir is provided "as is" without any warranties regarding uninterrupted service or accuracy.</li>
          <li>We are not responsible for any damages, losses, or issues arising from the use of the app.</li>
          <li>Users assume full responsibility for decisions made based on AI-generated recommendations.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>13. Termination & Account Suspension</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate these terms.</li>
          <li>Users may delete their accounts at any time by contacting <a href="mailto:sagar@kabir-ai.com">sagar@kabir-ai.com</a>.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>14. Changes to Terms</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>We may update these Terms from time to time. Continued use of the app after changes means you accept the updated terms.</li>
          <li>Users will be notified of significant changes via email or in-app notifications.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>15. Governing Law</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>These Terms shall be governed by and interpreted under the laws of India.</li>
          <li>Any disputes shall be resolved through arbitration or local courts, as applicable.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="terms-section">
        <h2>16. Contact Information</h2>
        <p>For questions or concerns regarding these Terms, you can contact:</p>
        <p>Email: <a href="mailto:sagar@kabir-ai.com">sagar@kabir-ai.com</a></p>
        <p>Website: <a href="https://www.kabir-ai.com">www.kabir-ai.com</a></p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="terms-footer">
        <p>By using Kabir, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agreed to these Terms and Conditions.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .terms-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }
  
  .page-title {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: #333;
  }
  
  .terms-meta {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e1e1e1;
  }
  
  .terms-intro {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  
  .terms-section {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  
  .terms-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: #c2634b;
  }
  
  .terms-section ul {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .terms-section li {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  
  .terms-footer {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #e1e1e1;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  
  a {
    color: #c2634b;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.3s;
  }
  
  a:hover {
    color: #ad5541;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .page-title {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }
    
    .terms-section h2 {
      font-size: 1.35rem;
    }
  }
</style>